# H2 database files from the archived OM2M gateway. These were tracked and the
# .mv.db held the ThingSpeak read and write keys plus the demo passwords in
# plain text, which no text scanner catches because the file is binary. They
# stay out of the repository; the data is still in git history and on the
# machine that produced it.
legacy/om2m-database/*.db
